From 36fa3fd3fd0fe4be8aff64972c59943186d03274 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 10:02:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 233/254] feat(backends): export backend view-alias
 capabilities for discovery

AVX-512 exposes AVX512_VIEW_CAPABILITY/view_alias_capability (supported,
proof-gated, contiguous_identity) and SVE256 exposes the unsupported
forbid/prefer capability, so the boundary is discoverable without reading the
artifact metadata.
